  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "What you see here is how much people\n",
        "around the world love Pokémon.\r",
        "Watching Battle Videos lets you share\n",
        "the fun these people had."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "This is a great idea.\n",
        "Anyone and everyone can participate.\r",
        "Even if you lose, that battle could still\n",
        "become an outstanding Battle Video."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "What stunning, gripping Battle Videos!\n",
        "Should I go home and retrain\f",
        "my Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "My Battle Videos starring only cute\n",
        "little MARILL are the ones I like best."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "What an amazing collection!\n",
        "I can see why this is so popular.\r",
        "Just seeing some of these Battle Videos\n",
        "makes me feel tougher!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "To treat one’s self to Battle Videos\n",
        "every day...\r",
        "I would consider that a hobby worthy\n",
        "of a true gentleman."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "My mysterious Battle Video.\n",
        "My mysterious Battle Video.\r",
        "What’s on it?\n",
        "What’s on it?\r",
        "It’s a mystery!\n",
        "It’s a mystery! And I mean it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Let me attempt the alphabet rap using\n",
        "Goldenrod, dig?\r",
        "G... Go south from here for the\n",
        "Ilex Forest.\r",
        "O... Over land is not where you’ll find\n",
        "the Goldenrod Tunnel.\r",
        "L... Looking like criminals in their black\n",
        "pajamas is Team Rocket.\r",
        "D... Um... D... is...\n",
        "Yeah, I know, lame-o.\f",
        "You give it a try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The Hiker enjoying the Box Data down\n",
        "on 2F is my little brother."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Warps to the GTS and the Trainer\n",
        "Rankings on 1F."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Warps to the studios for Box Data and\n",
        "Dress-Up Data on 2F."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\n",
        "Connection for Battle Videos? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Here, you may post a Battle Video of\n",
        "your Pokémon.\r",
        "You may also view Battle Videos posted\n",
        "by other Trainers.\r",
        "The Battle Videos may be sorted by\n",
        "Pokémon, battle facility, and so on.\r",
        "The Battle Video you post will be\n",
        "assigned a 12-digit number.\r",
        "Your friends may view your Battle Video\n",
        "by entering this 12-digit code here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00013",
      "en_US": "USE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0602_T25R1203_00014",
